										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Secure your share of indulgence with our Quarter Body Beef Pack, each averaging between 60-65kg, it&#8217;s approx.. $13.50 per KG! Elevate your culinary experiences with a carefully curated selection of premium Grass-Fed Angus Beef cuts, conveniently packed for your convenience.</p>
