		<item>
		<title>Deervale Farms Eight of a Beast ( 100% Grass Fed and Finished )</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/deervale-farms-eight-of-a-beast-100-grass-fed-and-finished/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/deervale-farms-eight-of-a-beast-100-grass-fed-and-finished/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[farmerbutcher_t66bou]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 19 Mar 2025 18:11:53 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=20444</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<h2><strong>Pack Contents </strong></h2>
<p>You get a mixture of cuts . Sometimes more of one sometimes less .</p>
<h3><strong>You should expect a minimum of 15kg of beef in your box</strong></h3>
<p>You’re purchasing a side of beef split evenly between four people, so you get a little bit of everything in your pack. This pack is great for two, as you get 2 of most cuts except for the eye fillet where sometimes you’ll only get one piece</p>
<ul>
<li>Bbq steak</li>
<li>Silverside</li>
<li>Sausages (Gluten Free)</li>
<li>A Grade Mince</li>
<li>Beef ribs</li>
<li>Brisket</li>
<li>T bone</li>
<li>Y bone</li>
<li>Rib fillet</li>
<li>Osso Bucco</li>
<li>Rump</li>
<li>Round</li>
</ul>
<p>Trim and Bones will also be included in the weight</p>
<h3>Order Timeframes</h3>
<p>Please note that all orders are made “to order” we need to sell a full cow before orders can be filled.</p>
<p>Please allow 4-5 weeks for your order to be dispatched.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/deervale-farms-eight-of-a-beast-100-grass-fed-and-finished/">Deervale Farms Eight of a Beast ( 100% Grass Fed and Finished )</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/deervale-farms-eight-of-a-beast-100-grass-fed-and-finished/">Deervale Farms Eight of a Beast ( 100% Grass Fed and Finished )</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
